{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0059","paragraphs":[{"id":"p2b88a5328646-1","text":"东风著意。"},{"id":"p25ac444685f9-1","text":"先上小桃枝。"},{"id":"p8c713ccebe2f-1","text":"红粉腻。"},{"id":"p56febfd00ad2-1","text":"娇如醉。"},{"id":"p8cbfc8419dc5-1","text":"倚朱扉。"},{"id":"p7a415ba37aac-1","text":"记年时。"},{"id":"p64efa4386d6b-1","text":"隐映新妆，面临水岸。"},{"id":"pc71b7799b356-1","text":"春将半。"},{"id":"p2cd088d0d78d-1","text":"云日暖。"},{"id":"p620501afb3da-1","text":"斜桥转。"},{"id":"p2005831f71bc-1","text":"夹城西。"},{"id":"p6c93e611ab3f-1","text":"草软莎平跋马，垂杨渡、玉勒争嘶。"},{"id":"p48e2970ec207-1","text":"认蛾眉凝笑，脸薄拂燕支。"},{"id":"pace3a77efd04-1","text":"绣户曾窥。"},{"id":"peff4cb30bd5a-1","text":"恨依依。"},{"id":"p725fbbe9b674-1","text":"共携手处。"},{"id":"p8ec52dd6a6d9-1","text":"香如雾。"},{"id":"pd0beb2282a74-1","text":"红随步。"},{"id":"p93cda0c22836-1","text":"怨春迟。"},{"id":"p91df6a4c7df1-1","text":"消瘦损。"},{"id":"p29496f21c1a7-1","text":"凭谁问。"},{"id":"p1f2a57613f5e-1","text":"只花知。"},{"id":"pe92af5bf82c8-1","text":"泪空垂。"},{"id":"p947be272c052-1","text":"旧日堂前燕，和烟雨，又双飞。"},{"id":"p4d219b4e39ca-1","text":"人自老。"},{"id":"p95c2c84aa012-1","text":"春长好。"},{"id":"p2adaa640872e-1","text":"梦佳期。"},{"id":"p5f3d688a73b0-1","text":"前度刘郎，几许风流地，花也应悲。"},{"id":"p131be33bec86-1","text":"但茫茫暮霭，目断武陵溪。"},{"id":"p775c63ad4192-1","text":"往事难追。"}]}